Hi <%= @user.display_name %>,

We got a request to reset the password for your Clempo account. Open this link to choose a new one:

<%= edit_password_url(@user.password_reset_token) %>

This link works for <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, @user.password_reset_token_expires_in) %>. After that, you can ask for a new one from the sign-in page.

Didn't ask for this? You can ignore this email — your password won't change.

— Clempo
